    title: "Space Tunnel",
    description: Some("Hunting a new planet, you stray into a tunnel where UFOs surface above and below you, firing shots that ricochet off the side walls. Your bomb flies whichever way your craft points, so aiming means turning. Brushing a wall or a UFO costs a ship, and the colour of the walls tells you what the next kill is worth."),
